. La aplicaci\u00f3n cuenta con una interfaz clara y accesible, f\u00e1cil de navegar con las gafas puestas. Crea, edita y elimina alarmas con gestos sencillos y disfruta de notificaciones visuales y sonoras claras que te garantizan que nunca te pierdas un momento importante, ya sea que est\u00e9s jugando, trabajando o relaj\u00e1ndote en RV.", "short_description": "Esta alarma tiene: Temporizador, Cron\u00f3metro y alarma de conversi\u00f3n."}, {"images": {"nodes": [{"file_name": "portrait.png", "id": "2905496342955542", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_PORTRAIT", "uri": "https://scontent-atl3-3.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/507823984_2905496346288875_7146297178865334511_n.png?_nc_cat=110&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=nYU3VPTMjksQ7kNvwHiq84b&_nc_oc=AdnXMmcK78ETSvbcv2Gc3k-1eC7cY3AHMLyF3lCUNkeIRuSKvfFBaqzxIGk4M-KD4u8&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-atl3-3.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=8&oh=00_AfyoB2D9fcHG_62PowPw1hgWOgLw0TIQyRN0-1cRRxSAQw&oe=69BAA23E"}, {"file_name": "icono-512.png", "id": "2243906042732063", "image_type": "APP_IMG_ICON", "uri": "https://scontent-atl3-3.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499618482_2243906046065396_1094352884120925797_n.png?_nc_cat=109&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=cWIo3ACP0MoQ7kNvwFxvqG0&_nc_oc=AdnL7iO5SB4B2Vg-BU2T2a7hTTcg7yN5mxAP7a4OJIJETAB3YnsthQnqbl8n2T8_DoQ&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-atl3-3.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=8&oh=00_AfwGc007XMm2Jzy-m-JzpxUbWttmXpmtB1O1MLMrag4ehw&oe=69BA809E"}, {"file_name": "square.png", "id": "1745867016009353", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_SQUARE", "uri": "https://scontent-atl3-3.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491831056_1745867019342686_1501165532938032609_n.png?_nc_cat=111&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=OSwOiLLsg7kQ7kNvwGLx8Pg&_nc_oc=Adm3vQdQdGvypKxeVE67C7G-1aTmHg5VOj081-aZUYINuJ0Dx4W76n5r4JMn8Sfei7Q&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-atl3-3.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=8&oh=00_Afz8r3Kt6stdjcwGHhDLvEtuxtg0dP1-G6xZeHk4Pn4UDA&oe=69BAAE5B"}, {"file_name": "hero cover.png", "id": "1368705761087761", "image_type": "APP_IMG_HERO", "uri": "https://scontent-atl3-3